# SOH [Quest] These three were separate repositories, vendored in from what used to be
# submodules. Their blobs carry their own line endings - some CRLF - and at least one of them
# (libultraship's stormlib-optimizations.patch) is fed to `git apply` at configure time, where a
# normalised line ending means a patch that no longer applies. Keep them byte-for-byte.
libultraship/** -text
ZAPDTR/** -text
